# Tests (`tests/**`)

- Every test annotates `/** @covers … */` with SPEC rule ids and/or `T*` case ids.
- **I5:** No `setTimeout`, `waitForTimeout`, `sleep`, or `retry` in tests. Enforced by `scripts/check-no-waiting.mjs`.
- Behaviour tests drive state via the command interface (`SPEC.md` § 13.4), not pointer gestures.
- Assert via inspector or rendered result, never internal component objects (E2).
